{'query': 'average cost of 3-star hotel in Singapore for two people per night', 'results': [{'title': 'How Much Do Hotels Cost in Singapore? Hotel Prices for Singapore ...', 'url': 'https://www.budgetyourtrip.com/hotels/singapore-SG', 'snippet': "The chart below shows the range of terrific 2-star hotel prices for a one night stay in Singapore. If you're trying to figure out how much you should pay for a great 2-star hotel, this graph tabulates the surprisingly affordable prices by category."}, {'title': 'Best 3-Star Hotels in Singapore from $91 | KAYAK', 'url': 'https://www.kayak.com/Singapore-Hotels_3-stars.Hts.20828.hotel.ksp', 'snippet': 'Ambassador Transit Hotel - Terminal 2 is the closest 3-star hotel to Singapore Changi at 0.1 mi away. Ambassador Transit Hotel - Terminal 2 is rated 8.1 on KAYAK and costs around $202 per night.'}, {'title': '3-star hotels in Singapore - Skyscanner', 'url': 'https://www.skyscanner.com.sg/hotels/singapore/singapore-hotels/three-star/ci-27546111/sr-3', 'snippet': 'The cheapest month to stay in a hotel in Singapore is September, with an average price of $194 per night. The most expensive month is June, when the average room rate can rise to $457 per night.'}, {'title': 'Best 3-star Hotels in Singapore - Latest Prices & Reviews', 'url': 'https://in.trip.com/hotels/star3/city/sg/singapore.html', 'snippet': 'Find the best deals on 154 3-star hotels in Singapore. Compare latest prices and deals, read real guest reviews, view photos and check availability on Trip.com.'}, {'title': 'The Best 3-Star Singapore Hotels | Where to Stay in Singapore', 'url': 'https://www.priceoftravel.com/hotels/3-star-singapore-hotels', 'snippet': 'Current data shows that 3-star hotels in Singapore average around $84 to $118 USD per night, with significant variations depending on when you visit and where you stay.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.8094528000074206}
{'query': 'average transportation cost for 4 days in Singapore for two people', 'results': [{'title': 'Singapore Travel Cost - Average Price of a Vacation to Singapore: Food & Meal Budget, Daily & Weekly Expenses | Budget Your Trip', 'url': 'https://www.budgetyourtrip.com/singapore', 'snippet': 'June 21, 2026 - Below are the average prices for each budget category. (Prices in U.S. Dollars, before taxes & fees.) ... On average, past travelers have spent $11 (SG$14) per person, per day, on local transportation in Singapore.'}, {'title': 'The Cost of Travel in Singapore: My 2026 Budget Breakdown', 'url': 'https://www.neverendingfootsteps.com/cost-of-travel-singapore-budget/', 'snippet': 'June 29, 2026 - You have to take it from Mount ... plan on using the metro as your sole way of getting around, you can expect to average $8▾ a day on transportation. A Singapore Sling from Raffles?...'}, {'title': 'Unveiling the Spectacular Expenses: Your Guide to the Trip to Singapore Cost 2026 | Trip.com', 'url': 'https://www.trip.com/guide/info/trip-to-singapore-cost.html', 'snippet': 'March 6, 2025 - Transportation: Getting around Singapore is convenient and efficient. The Mass Rapid Transit (MRT) system covers most areas of the city and is an affordable mode of transportation. A 7-day unlimited MRT pass costs around $45 per person.'}, {'title': 'Singapore on a Budget: Exact Costs & 4-Day Itinerary | DriftPosts', 'url': 'https://www.driftposts.com/en/blog/singapore-on-a-budget-itinerary-costs', 'snippet': 'March 14, 2026 - Singapore is hot and humid, but walking is your best friend for budget travel. We relied on a mix of heavy walking and the public MRT system. By avoiding taxis entirely, our total transportation cost came out to just $9 USD per day per person.'}, {'title': 'Singapore Trip Cost from India Complete Breakdown in 2026 | Bajaj Finance', 'url': 'https://www.bajajfinserv.in/singapore-trip-cost-from-india', 'snippet': 'August 29, 2025 - 4,500 per night to luxury hotels costing upwards of Rs. 15,000 per night. With the aid of a personal loan, you can choose accommodations that enhance your trip’s enjoyment without overextending your budget.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 2.72236640000483}
{'query': 'entry fees for major attractions in Singapore (Gardens by the Bay, Singapore Zoo, Sentosa Island, Marina Bay Sands)', 'results': [{'title': 'Gardens by the Bay Entrance Fee 2026: Official Prices, Who Pays What, and What’s Actually Worth It - Gardens By The Bay Website', 'url': 'https://gardens-by-the-bay.org/entrance-fee/', 'snippet': 'April 7, 2026 - Klook Pass Singapore — best for stacking Gardens with other major sights · Singapore: Starry Night Cruise, Garden Rhapsody & Spectra — strongest after-dark Marina Bay combo · Private Tour sightseeing Marina Bay Sands+River Cruise(Max6) — private splurge with skyline-and-river energy · This page is built to clear up the part that confuses most travelers. First, it breaks down the official fee structure. Then it shows which attractions are actually worth paying for, who qualifies for resident rates, and when a reseller bundle is easier than buying piece by piece.'}, {'title': 'Gardens By The Bay In Singapore Entry Fees - Check Ticket Price, Charges and Online Booking Details for Indian & Foreigner (updated 2025) | TT', 'url': 'https://traveltriangle.com/singapore-tourism/sentosa/places-to-visit/gardens-by-the-bay/entry-fees', 'snippet': 'The Cost for the Skyway is around ... residents can buy tickets for one attraction at around Rs 635 for adults and around Rs 425 for children and senior citizens....'}, {'title': 'Gardens By The Bay, Singapore - Timings, Entry Fee, Best Time to Visit', 'url': 'https://www.trawell.in/singapore/singapore/gardens-by-the-bay', 'snippet': 'Gardens By The Bay near Singapore - discover Timings, Entry Fee, Best Time to Visit, trip duration, distance, near by places, location with route map & directions and photos.'}, {'title': 'Gardens by the Bay Tickets: Prices, Tips and How to Save', 'url': 'https://alike.io/blog/gardens-by-the-bay-tickets-guide', 'snippet': 'March 12, 2026 - For budget travellers and backpackers, a free evening visit for the light show is one of the best free things to do in Singapore. Gardens by the Bay sits in the Marina Bay area, one of the most walkable zones in the city. Within a 15-minute walk you have Marina Bay Sands (with its observation deck, casino, and shopping mall), the ArtScience Museum, Helix Bridge, and the Esplanade performing arts centre.'}, {'title': '20 Best Singapore Attractions Ticket Price List - 2026', 'url': 'https://www.thrillophilia.com/singapore-attractions-price-list', 'snippet': 'January 19, 2026 - Browse through a wide range of Singapore Attractions tickets like Universal Studios Singapore Tickets, Gardens by the Bay Tickets, Singapore Flyer Sky Dining, Sentosa Fun Pass, S E A Aquarium Singapore Tickets, and many more. Singapore Attractions Ticket Price List has gone a little too far with its pocket-friendly tour packages.'}], 'result_count': 5, 'duration_seconds': 4.320779899993795}

